                <pb facs="0628" n="546" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg546"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1216M/140.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Mexican
                    Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-11-28"><hi rendition="#italic">November 28,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Transmits a paraphrase of the above telegram of November 26 to the American
                    ambassador, and suggests the negotiation of a treaty for the maintenance of the
                    levee after it is completed.</p>
            </div>
